  "limits": [
    "Real kernel Seatbelt restrictions from the deprecated sandbox-exec utility, real ad-hoc signatures and Hardened Runtime. The harness does not launch an entitlement-based App Sandbox bundle or create a per-user container.",
    "No Powerbox, distributed scoped bookmarks, Developer ID/team signing or signed upgrade, XPC/launchd service, external volume, remount, hot-WAL recovery or throughput was qualified. The production SwiftUI bookmark and packaging route were inspected and unchanged.",
    "The private service exclusively owns the fixture namespace and executable paths. Registered PID and kernel audit-token-backed dynamic CDHash are checked before FD/command release. OS pathname access is configured at launch. No retroactive revocation of previously issued FDs or pathname permissions is claimed.",
    "The mount-root metadata requirement was measured for this OS/version and APFS mount layout. Explicit writes are limited to the approved SQLite names and the selected output folder. The fixture uses no recursive mount grant and no system-wide hook."
  ],
